Streamable HTTP error: Error POSTing to endpoint: <!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Internal Server Error - 500</title>
<style>
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  background: #f5f5f5;
  color: #333;
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 100vh;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20px;
}
.card {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 60px 40px;
  max-width: 480px;
  width: 100%;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}
.icon { width: 80px; height: 80px; background: #fff7e6; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 24px; font-size: 36px; }
h1 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #262626; }
.code { font-size: 14px; color: #bbb; margin-bottom: 12px; }
p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #666; margin-bottom: 24px; }
.btn { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; background: #1677ff; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; transition: background 0.2s; }
.btn:hover { background: #4096ff; }
.footer { margin-top: 32px; font-size: 13px; color: #bbb; }
.footer a { color: #999; text-decoration: none; }
.footer a:hover { color: #666; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
  <div class="icon">🔧</div>
  <h1>Internal Server Error</h1>
  <div class="code">HTTP 500</div>
  <p>Something went wrong on our end. Our team has been notified.</p>
  <a href="/" class="btn">← Back to Homepage</a>
  <div class="footer"><a href="/">www.theytree.com</a></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
